    <section class='grid' aria-label='Testimonials'>
      <article class='card reveal'>
        <div class='quote'>“I used to wait for big motivation. Now I lean on a 5-minute evening micro-routine that signals the day is closing. That small habit made mornings calmer.”</div>
        <div class='meta'>— Alex, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
